title: "Bandwidth-Aware Constraint Scheduling for Trust-Weighted Multi-Robot Map Fusion under Duty-Cycle-Limited Wireless Links"
abstract: >-
  Simulation backbone for Bandwidth-Aware Constraint Scheduling (BACS), which
  moves the trust decision from the fusion receiver to the transmitter under
  duty-cycle-limited (LoRa EU868) wireless links.
authors:
  - name: "Author names withheld for double-anonymous review"
